  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/874/273/2024-05-25_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p>掠奪者風暴即將來襲....</p><p>歡迎使用《斬殺掠奪者》</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模組為《拔刀劍》擴充內容，新增名為「刀術大師」的掠奪者拔刀劍高手。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>切勿靠近此敵人，否則將被斬擊——就像你用拔刀劍斬殺生物那樣...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>突襲事件中請格外小心...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">製作群</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">刀術大師（又名武士）出自本人模組&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bagus-mob\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bagus Mob</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">刀術大師模型由&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Itz_BlueJacob</span>提供</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">必要項目</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slash Blade Resharped</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player Animator</a></span></p>",
